    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rpai](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rpai) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 128.344 depth occurred on Nov 20 2025 15km SE of Passo. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -3.7031 longitude 128.3705. It impacted 131020 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
